# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Personal portfolio assets (template hygiene)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# This project is a portfolio template — the photo and resume in /public are
# personal binary assets that each user should replace with their own.
# We ignore them by default so forks don't accidentally ship the original
# author's files. To commit your own:
#   1. Drop your photo / resume into /public
#   2. Reference them from src/portfolio.config.ts (assets.photo / assets.resume)
#   3. Either remove these patterns OR add explicit `!public/your-file.pdf` lines
# public/photo.*
# public/*.pdf
# public/resume.*
